    "display_name": "Fix the Layout",
    "long_instructions": "##Do This:\r\n\r\nWith the help of AI, fix the spacing, alignment, and layout problems so the page feels clean and consistent.\r\n- Before saving your changes, resize the preview to check how the page behaves on smaller screens. If sections overlap, spacing breaks, or elements stop fitting, refine your CSS to improve the layout.\r\n\r\nMake one request at a time (one section, one fix), then preview before asking for the next change.",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Fix layout issues such as spacing and alignment.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/1fec9cb6841e171b1e2ac2a3085e48de-layout.png",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>NoiseLab — Music Club Showcase</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#home\">\n        <span class=\"logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\">♬</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">NoiseLab</span>\n      </a>\n\n      <nav class=\"primary-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <ul class=\"nav\">\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#shows\">Shows</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#playlists\">Playlists</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#join\">Join</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <!-- HERO (misaligned on purpose) -->\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n      <div class=\"hero-inner\">\n        <h1>Music Club Showcase</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">\n          Discover student bands, open mics, and curated playlists.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#shows\">See Upcoming Shows</a>\n          <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"#playlists\">Browse Playlists</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <img class=\"hero-art\" src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/poster/980/500\" alt=\"Poster collage\" />\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- SHOW GRID (gaps/widths broken on purpose) -->\n    <section class=\"shows\" id=\"shows\" aria-label=\"Upcoming shows\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <h2>Upcoming Shows</h2>\n        <p class=\"sub\">Lineups from the next few weeks</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"show-grid\">\n        <article class=\"show-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/a/420/290\" alt=\"Band A poster\" />\n          <h3>Friday Night — Gym Stage</h3>\n          <p>Three bands. Doors at 6. Bring your student ID.</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"show-card tall\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/b/520/220\" alt=\"Band B poster\" />\n          <h3>Open Mic — Commons</h3>\n          <p>Acoustic sets and poetry. Sign up early!</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"show-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/c/360/400\" alt=\"Band C poster\" />\n          <h3>Battle of the Bands</h3>\n          <p>Vote for your favorite set. Prizes + food trucks.</p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"show-card\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/d/480/260\" alt=\"Band D poster\" />\n          <h3>Jazz Night — Auditorium</h3>\n          <p>Small ensembles and featured soloists.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PLAYLISTS (alignment & spacing issues) -->\n    <section class=\"playlists\" id=\"playlists\" aria-label=\"Club playlists\">\n      <div class=\"section-header off-center\">\n        <h2>Playlists</h2>\n        <p class=\"sub\">Curated by student DJs</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"playlist-row\">\n        <article class=\"playlist\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/pl1/320/320\" alt=\"Playlist cover\" />\n          <div class=\"pl-meta\">\n            <h3>Focus Beats</h3>\n            <p>Lo-fi, ambient, and calm synths</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"playlist\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/pl2/280/320\" alt=\"Playlist cover\" />\n          <div class=\"pl-meta\">\n            <h3>Hype Mix</h3>\n            <p>High-energy tracks for practice</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"playlist\">\n          <img src=\"https://picsum.photos/seed/pl3/360/260\" alt=\"Playlist cover\" />\n          <div class=\"pl-meta\">\n            <h3>Indie Finds</h3>\n            <p>New sounds from small artists</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- JOIN (padding/width oddities) -->\n    <section class=\"join\" id=\"join\" aria-label=\"Join the club\">\n      <h2>Join the Club</h2>\n      <p>We meet Tuesdays after school in Room 214.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"#apply\">Apply Now</a>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n      <p>© 2025 NoiseLab Music Club</p>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Footer\">\n        <ul class=\"nav footer-nav\">\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#code\">Code of Conduct</a></li>\n          <li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li>\n        </ul>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "styles.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  background: #f6f7fb;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n}\n\nh1,\nh2,\nh3 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\n.skip-link {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: -9999px;\n  top: auto;\n}\n\n.skip-link:focus {\n  left: 16px;\n  top: 16px;\n  background: black;\n  color: white;\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: 980px;\n  margin-left: 18px;\n  margin-right: 0;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  background: white;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n}\n\n.header-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 8px 0;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.logo {\n  color: #e11d48;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n}\n\n.nav {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 28px;\n  list-style: none;\n  margin: 0 6px 0 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\n.nav-link {\n  text-decoration: none;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  padding: 4px 6px;\n}\n\n.hero {\n  background: white;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  padding: 10px 0 14px;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.hero .container {\n  width: 930px;\n}\n\n.hero-inner {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;\n  column-gap: 10px;\n  align-items: start;\n  transform: translateX(-6px);\n}\n\n.lede {\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.hero-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.hero-art {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 122%;\n  left: -22px;\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 22px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n}\n\n.shows {\n  padding: 12px 0;\n}\n\n.section-header {\n  margin: 0 10px 8px 20px;\n}\n\n.section-header .sub {\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.show-grid {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 14px 8px;\n  padding: 0 8px;\n}\n\n.show-card {\n  background: white;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  width: 31%;\n}\n\n.show-card:first-child {\n  width: 62%;\n}\n\n.show-card:nth-child(3) {\n  width: 46%;\n}\n\n.show-card img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 215px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.show-card.tall p {\n  margin-bottom: 36px;\n}\n\n.playlists {\n  background: white;\n  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  padding: 10px 0;\n}\n\n.off-center {\n  margin-left: 26px;\n}\n\n.playlist-row {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 0 10px;\n}\n\n.playlist {\n  width: 26%;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n  align-items: stretch;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.playlist:nth-child(2) {\n  width: 38%;\n}\n\n.playlist img {\n  width: 104px;\n  height: 130px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.pl-meta p {\n  color: #6b7280;\n}\n\n.join {\n  width: 87%;\n  margin-left: 5%;\n  padding: 10px 0 8px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.site-footer {\n  background: white;\n  border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.footer-inner {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  padding: 6px 4px;\n}\n\n.footer-nav .nav-link {\n  color: #6b7280;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  background: white;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background: #e11d48;\n  border-color: #e11d48;\n  color: white;\n}\n\n.btn-secondary {\n  color: #e11d48;\n  border-color: #e11d48;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
