nf6WP\n",
    "name_suffix": "_2026",
    "teacher_markdown": "- **Keep it incremental.**  \r\n  Coach students to fix one section at a time (cards, then hero, then footer) and preview after each change.\r\n\r\n- **Require a quick plan before prompting.**  \r\n  If students ask for “fix the whole layout,” redirect them to name a specific goal, what must stay consistent, and what might break.\r\n\r\n- **Watch for fixes that create new problems.**  \r\n  Common issues: sections drifting off-center, uneven card heights, elements overlapping, or spacing that looks fine on one part but breaks another.\r\n\r\n- **Push for clear version comments.**  \r\n  Have students name the exact layout improvement (what changed) and why it matters for clarity/usability before saving.",
